    "description": "The popular \"Messa\" watch faces are now on Google Play Wear OS.\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Over 1,000,000 downloads in Galaxy Store and Play Store.\r\n\ud83d\udd38 \"Messa\" is stylish and realistic dials.\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Combination of classic and digital modern design.\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Ease of use and minimalism.\r\n\ud83d\udc4d If you like our watch faces, write a positive review, it will help us a lot.\r\n<b>Compatible with devices:</b> Pixel Watch, Galaxy Watch 4, Galaxy Watch 5 and other devices.\r\n\r\n<b>Installation Information:</b>\r\n\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f\u2757\ufe0f If many watch faces appear as incompatible on the Google Play app, please access Google Play via a PC browser. The same applies to the installation of watch face.\r\n\r\nMake sure the watch is properly connected to the phone.\r\nAfter a few minutes the watch face was transferred on watch: check the watch faces installed by the Wearable app on the phone.\r\nPhone app have no use it's for easily installation of the watch face.\r\n\r\n<b>Our watch faces work on all popular smartwatches:</b> Galaxy Watch 5, Casio GSW-H1000, Casio WSD-F21HR, Fossil Gen 5 LTE, Fossil Gen 5e, Fossil Gen 6, Fossil Sport, Fossil Wear, Fossil Wear from Google Smartwatch, Mobvoi TicWatch C2, Mobvoi TicWatch E2/S2, Mobvoi TicWatch E3, Mobvoi TicWatch Pro, Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Cellular/LTE, Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 GPS, Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 4G, Montblanc SUMMIT, Montblanc Summit 2+, Montblanc Summit Lite, Motorola Moto 360, Movado Connect 2. 0, Samsung Galaxy Watch4 , Samsung, Galaxy Watch5, Samsung Galaxy Watch4 Classic, Suunto 7, TAG Heuer Connected 2020, Google Pixel watch and more.\r\n\r\nKey word: Rolex, Messa, watch, pixel, pixel watch, google, tag, omega, chronometer, oyster, daytona, black, gold, white, business, luxury, analog, classic, digital, face, watchface, free, apple, catalog, wearos, aluminum, classic, digital, sport, health, bpm, hearts, anime, animated, top, weather, customizations, samsung, dial, clock, smart, md, Luxe, Hublot, Heuer",
